# Nothing here yet.
#
# This build talks to no API: sign-in runs on the device (see
# src/state/AuthContext.tsx). EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL used to point at the Laravel
# backend (JAREESH-API) and no longer does anything — it was removed rather than
# left set, so nobody spends an afternoon wondering why changing it has no
# effect.
#
# When the API comes back, the note worth keeping is this: on a device the host
# must be the Mac's LAN address. "localhost" is the phone itself, so the request
# never leaves the handset and reads as the server being down. Find yours with:
# ipconfig getifaddr en0
